-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This licence covers everything in this repository. Unlike the private
development repository it is generated from, this distribution deliberately
contains NO third-party material, so the MIT grant above is unqualified.

Two things are outside it because they are not distributed here:

  * Reference documents (World Bank harmonization guidelines and workflow
    designs) that informed datalib's conventions. They are cited in the
    documentation but not reproduced. Obtain them from their publishers.

  * Survey microdata accessed THROUGH this software. datalib is a client; it
    ships no data. Each dataset is governed by the terms of its own provider
    (UNICEF MICS, DHS, national statistical offices), independent of this
    licence.
